{section:steps title='How it works', eyebrow='Three steps'}
  {section:item 'Write the data'}A <code>.php</code> file sets the variables of the page.{/section:item}
  {section:item 'Write the page'}A <code>.pad</code> file beside it says how they look.{/section:item}
  {section:item 'Open it'}The address is the file name - no route to declare.{/section:item}
{/section:steps}
